  "title": "SJR 78 (2024 Second Regular Session (102nd General Assembly)): SENATE SUBSTITUTE FOR SENATE JOINT RESOLUTION NO. 78: Submitting to the qualified voters of Missouri, an amendment repealing sections 2 and 3 of article VIII of the Constitution of Missouri, and adopting three new sections in lieu thereof relating to elections.",
  "urls": [
    "https://www.senate.mo.gov/24info/Journals/RDay460409652-660.pdf",
    "https://www.senate.mo.gov/24info/pdf-bill/tat/SJR78.pdf",
    "https://documents.house.mo.gov/billtracking/bills241/jrnpdf/jrn077.pdf",
